es","guid":"1R85r-01Ra6Gclkfma5WAA","children":[{"id":"148","parent":"147","text":"Marcapasos","guid":"DtUuwrDMS1Syzda9g8nAUA","children":[{"id":"149","parent":"148","text":"Ejercicio SEGURO con marcapasos","guid":"_Co4IgpNTA6cu-4_2589Hg","children":[]},{"id":"150","parent":"148","text":"Evitar movimientos extremos hombro ipsilateral primeras 6 semanas","guid":"usbtonlMQ5eUi1d8MVrpJg","children":[]},{"id":"151","parent":"148","text":"Ajustar sensor de respuesta en frecuencia si ejercicio intenso","guid":"j_0bSt4HTjK6G6d7wZUuHw","children":[]},{"id":"152","parent":"148","text":"Monitorizar umbrales post-ejercicio","guid":"Rczt0mvhRhyxrUVW3AMOkQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"153","parent":"147","text":"Anticoagulación","guid":"nsx6Px_7RlCpltwmRyiS0g","children":[{"id":"154","parent":"153","text":"Evitar deportes de contacto o alto riesgo de caída","guid":"uRjwxSMxRjO7tnE83oLJ_g","children":[]},{"id":"155","parent":"153","text":"Preferir ejercicio supervisado si INR inestable","guid":"dHpQFbhQQ2WSjHSynmOFPw","children":[]},{"id":"156","parent":"153","text":"ACODs → menor restricción vs warfarina","guid":"W6ApNXvQR7OvXQCOd-r_KA","children":[]},{"id":"157","parent":"153","text":"Hidroterapia → precaución si heridas","guid":"H7hH6SWWQR-B-FmYPPF3nA","children":[]}]},{"id":"158","parent":"147","text":"Valvulopatía","guid":"8n1cQSegSh293BcinjEkNA","children":[{"id":"159","parent":"158","text":"Post-TAVI → inicio precoz (caso Doña Carmen REHAB-HF)","guid":"JxQOin4xSyOPoLSoiZ2cNA","children":[]},{"id":"160","parent":"158","text":"Estenosis aórtica severa NO intervenida → ejercicio CONTRAINDICADO","guid":"4KK5AkijSk6HQqHPDlNa2w","children":[]},{"id":"161","parent":"158","text":"Insuficiencia mitral → ejercicio moderado seguro","guid":"1Ee7eeJkTs2tokmQc3w2dQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"162","parent":"147","text":"Dispositivos (DAI/TRC)","guid":"MyEtjxlYTNuujx0aE_U2Mg","children":[{"id":"163","parent":"162","text":"Establecer zona de FC segura bajo umbral de descarga","guid":"CNEuhtVaT5ilrB2Ys6if2w","children":[]},{"id":"164","parent":"162","text":"Evitar ejercicio que eleve FC >85% umbral de descarga","guid":"S3V9RFsZQQOE5T8XHYkIRw","children":[]},{"id":"165","parent":"162","text":"Ejercicio de fuerza → SEGURO si técnica correcta","guid":"wxe4wDruTYW_gftzHsXfhA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"166","parent":"0","text":"Equipo Multidisciplinario","guid":"5Qczlk0wRay5t0XHglZl-w","children":[{"id":"167","parent":"166","text":"Cardiólogo → prescripción, estratificación riesgo","guid":"hhqW-fK2SHC6QEi0O3H3QA","children":[]},{"id":"168","parent":"166","text":"Geriatra → VGI, fragilidad, polifarmacia, cognición","guid":"AaGJSRFLTmCKKaSydDPJtw","children":[]},{"id":"169","parent":"166","text":"Kinesiólogo/Fisioterapeuta → EJECUTOR principal del programa","guid":"XwvAeYpnQTmgPmX0leHZ2g","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"166","text":"Terapeuta Ocupacional → adaptación ABVD, ayudas técnicas","guid":"08FlLcVzQX2VSIq8MJGG6Q","children":[]},{"id":"171","parent":"166","text":"Nutricionista → sarcopenia, suplementación proteica","guid":"p32KWuWVR-qV0kF9inuC0g","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"166","text":"Psicólogo → motivación, adherencia, afrontamiento","guid":"UTvHGy3-R6-DLThdlyVBkQ","children":[]},{"id":"173","parent":"166","text":"Enfermera → educación, monitoreo, telerehabilitación","guid":"7NsZmbeGRLuT6E4aG8XG7g","children":[]}]},{"id":"174","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"bv8h5gVzRiSSxrVGCiHcIw","children":[{"id":"175","parent":"174","text":"REHAB-HF → multidominio > aeróbico solo en AM frágil con IC","guid":"stYSA5rATHOK_811WpONYQ","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"174","text":"Ejercicio es MEDICINA → prescribir con dosis, frecuencia, monitoreo","guid":"jX_REMPsRSG4WxGoa1AZFQ","children":[]},{"id":"177","parent":"174","text":"Borg 12-14 > FC objetivo en AM (cronotropismo negativo + BB)","guid":"TPnVwFR-Q_CYtp3owQFgeg","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"174","text":"CUALQUIER ejercicio > sedentarismo → todo movimiento es ganancia","guid":"sAK6eoSUSrOfuU3Cq6mwhQ","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"174","text":"Sarcopenia → entrenamiento de fuerza OBLIGATORIO en AM con IC","guid":"Nd5VLZpsQ_ajcdEc2gYJcQ","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"174","text":"6MWT <300m → umbral de fragilidad funcional en IC","guid":"vbsRNITBSme3IC0Z7hStQQ","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"174","text":">6 horas sentado/día → ↑ mortalidad por todas las causas","guid":"IAQh3_-0TrC7OXlsA-UuRg","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"174","text":"Desacondicionamiento es FÍSICO y CEREBRAL → motivación es clave","guid":"59mF6UuhT3mZzNJ78VNhzQ","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"174","text":"Post-TAVI → inicio precoz rehabilitación multidominio","guid":"Byh48dfZSAOeYS40Jy7zRg","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"174","text":"Solo 20-30% de pacientes IC son derivados a RC → BRECHA ENORME","guid":"IwN8UAMIRUqEtLDGJcj9sA","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"174","text":"Telerehabilitación = eficacia similar a presencial","guid":"0WsckINrTSahefL7vXEyjQ","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"174","text":"Talk Test = herramienta práctica de intensidad en domicilio","guid":"0eGhKIYYR8SeYK10RpZ48A","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"174","text":"Referencias","guid":"bjkRQb1KQLiFCUTrbjy_Ig","children":[{"id":"188","parent":"187","text":"1. Kitzman DW et al. Physical rehabilitation for older patients hospitalized for HF (REHAB-HF). N Engl J Med. 2021;385(3):203-16.","guid":"vUsbArL_RV6RVrJH2AW9wQ","children":[]},{"id":"189","parent":"187","text":"2. Long L et al. Exercise-based cardiac rehabilitation for adults with HF. Cochrane Database Syst Rev. 2019;1(1):CD003331.","guid":"p3f9lWeVSMKSVw7NwWanwg","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"187","text":"3. O'Connor CM et al. Efficacy and safety of exercise training in patients with chronic HF (HF-ACTION). JAMA. 2009;301(14):1439-50.","guid":"9lY92QpaR2mCxbWatv9L5w","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"187","text":"4. McDonagh TA et al. 2021 ESC Guidelines for diagnosis and treatment of acute and chronic HF. Eur Heart J. 2021;42(36):3599-726.","guid":"GeLBvo9rTcyAXJOrQIg0Og","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"187","text":"5. Virani SS et al. AHA/ACC Guidelines for management of HF. Circulation. 2022;145(18):e895-e1032.","guid":"B0CvGUGRR2e_l_10L3bxJw","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"187","text":"6. Reeves GR et al. Rehabilitation therapy in older acute HF patients (REHAB-HF): secondary analysis. Circ Heart Fail. 2022;15(5):e009083.","guid":"h7MwcicMShuzOP3YqMCGpg","children":[]},{"id":"194","parent":"187","text":"7. Taylor RS et al. Exercise-based rehabilitation for HF. J Am Coll Cardiol. 2019;73(12):1430-43.","guid":"2wY7RRp8RuuLyMGyXifTLw","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"187","text":"8. Izawa KP et al. Telerehabilitation for heart failure patients: systematic review and meta-analysis. Heart Fail Rev. 2023;28(4):903-14.","guid":"xDGromCjRLyy3HDNvZZ86A","children":[]}]}]}]},"node_count":195,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Cardiología","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Cardiología","filename":"Anticoagulación-2024","id":"map_36","resolved_references":[]}